<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" version="2.0"><channel><title>Blogging – justaddwater.dk</title><link>https://watson.github.io/justaddwater.dk/tag/blogging/</link><description>Instant Usability &amp;amp; Web Standards — static archive</description><language>en-US</language><atom:link href="https://watson.github.io/justaddwater.dk/tag/blogging/feed/" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml" /><item><title>Presentation for corporate weblogging event</title><link>https://watson.github.io/justaddwater.dk/2006/06/13/weblog-event/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">http://justaddwater.dk/2006/06/13/weblog-event/</guid><dc:creator>Jesper Rønn-Jensen</dc:creator><pubDate>Tue, 13 Jun 2006 05:30:08 +0000</pubDate><description>&lt;p&gt;This morning we’re speaking in about corporate weblogs in Copenhagen, Denmark. It’s hosted by the &lt;a href="http://www.itb.dk/site.asp?p=51"&gt;Danish IT Industry Association&lt;/a&gt;, and We’ll be speaking on the experiences with this blog and how it relates to our jobs at Capgemini.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The presentation is in Danish. More info on previous blog post “&lt;a href="https://watson.github.io/justaddwater.dk/2006/05/15/speaking-on-corporate-weblogging-event/" rel="bookmark" title="Permanent Link: Speaking on Corporate Weblogging event"&gt;Speaking on Corporate Weblogging event&lt;/a&gt;“.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Powerpoint version: &lt;a href="https://watson.github.io/justaddwater.dk/wp-content/pres_2006-06-13_blogging.ppt" title="Capgemini justaddwater.dk blogging 2006-06-13, 2.1MB Powerpoint presentation"&gt;Capgemini og Justaddwater.dk&lt;/a&gt; (2.1MB)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;PDF version: &lt;a href="https://watson.github.io/justaddwater.dk/wp-content/uploads/2006/06/pres%202006-06-13%20blogging.pdf" id="p309" title="PDF version: Capgemini og Justaddwater.dk"&gt;Capgemini og Justaddwater.dk&lt;/a&gt; (1.4MB)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’d love to hear your comments on our presentation (especially if you were there).&lt;/p&gt;
